{"2403250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Armor Attack", "steam_appid": 2403250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.poster.avif?t=1777461344\" width=624 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.webm?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.mp4?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor Attack</strong> is a third-person shooter that kicks-off an all-out sci-fi ground warfare using all possible variations of mech battle technologies including shooting robots, tanks, wheeled machines, hovers mounted with deadly weapons that can be combined for robot and tank wars in a very tactical way. Battle game features 5v5 intense but slow-paced gameplay in an evolving realistic environment. In this shooting game you can build your  winning strategy at any range with any unit classes, robots, tanks and with any weapon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF VEHICLE TYPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shooting game you create a dropteam of big sci-fi battle machines for in-game robot fighting. Each of them has its pros and cons in controls, positioning, speed and mobility. And each of them has its tactical ability to change the course of a battle game in this war of robots and tanks. Play this action PvP shooter, cut escape routes with AOE deadly zones, set your own obstacles in the robot and tank game and block the enemy in the narrow corridors, hunt them being invisible and observe targets from the top of the buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.poster.avif?t=1777461344\" width=624 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.webm?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.mp4?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR WEAPON COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons in Armor Attack battle game are crafted to support a tactical variety of vehicle classes: robots, tanks, machines. Also weapons benefit from the environment landscape, obstacles on a map and use of your own abilities. Combination of vehicle types, abilities and weapon builds gives you ever-evolving ways to plan, attack and defuse every situation in war strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAPS ARE YOUR ENEMIES BUT ALSO FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump right in the middle of PvP shooter intense combat of robots and tanks or trick the opponent using flanks, moving platforms or high ground of this war game. But never forget about robot and tank game-changing mechanics happening in every mech battle. Be it an ever-changing map layout, strategically important vantage point or a huge AI controlled boss, it has the potential to turn the tides of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.poster.avif?t=1777461344\" width=624 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.webm?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.mp4?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD OF ARMOR ATTACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in alternate future of the robot and tank wars that happened in the Mid-20th Century, Armor Attack drops players in the middle of a modern war between three shooting factions: Bastion, protecting the Old World, Hermits who want to evolve life on Earth and establish new order of things, and the Empyreals who decided to build a new hub for the people outside of their home planet. Each faction has its own playstyle and unique visual design to give players choice how to fit their tactical and shooting skills to the actual gameplay of the shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.poster.avif?t=1777461344\" width=624 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.webm?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.mp4?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.poster.avif?t=177746134