class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD OF ARMOR ATTACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in alternate future of the robot and tank wars that happened in the Mid-20th Century, Armor Attack drops players in the middle of a modern war between three shooting factions: Bastion, protecting the Old World, Hermits who want to evolve life on Earth and establish new order of things, and the Empyreals who decided to build a new hub for the people outside of their home planet. Each faction has its own playstyle and unique visual design to give players choice how to fit their tactical and shooting skills to the actual gameplay of the shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.poster.avif?t=1777461344\" width=624 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.webm?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.mp4?t=1777461344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Armor Attack is a tactical 5v5 PvP battle game where robots, tanks, and hovers clash for battlefield control. Combine powerful weapons and unique abilities to outmaneuver your opponents.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Indonesian, Hindi", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/ea85b74b5eb48c08e0e53f58bef94ae1b74ceb0d/header.jpg?t=1777461344", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/eb264639b997a8108f60b72eb47b